{"root":{"data":{"id":"dml8ppmndqo0","created":1793674978493,"text":"4 GPS 卫星信号和导航电文"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dml92yrdfeo0","created":1793676017104,"text":"GPS卫星信号","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlc5ane1wo0","created":1793684663042,"text":"GPS卫星信号是调制波"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlc5kgq4qo0","created":1793684684407,"text":"载波","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm6y34u0mo0","created":1793771552541,"text":"GPS使用L波段的两种载频"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm6x8zau7c0","created":1793771486903,"text":"时钟基准频率为：f0 = 10.23 MHz"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm6yc6r14w0","created":1793771572248,"text":"L1 载波","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm6yl6cqqw0","created":1793771591815,"text":"fL1 = 154 * f0 = 1575.42 MHz，波长 λ1 = 19.032 cm"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm89shsvfs0","created":1793775290860,"text":"L1C/A      传统信号，目前仍广泛使用，保证了向后兼容性"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm8abfc2bk0","created":1793775332070,"text":"L1C         最新的民用信号，设计用于与其他GNSS（如Galileo）互操作，是L1 C/A的现代化替代"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm6yf38x340","created":1793771578566,"text":"L2C 载波"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm6yl6cqqw0","created":1793771591815,"text":"fL2 = 120 * f0 = 1227.6 MHz，波长 λ2 = 24.42 cm"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm89yp6hko0","created":1793775304367,"text":"第二个民用信号，专为商业需求设计，与L1组合可实现双频电离层校正，提升精度"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm7ht205200","created":1793773097885,"text":"L5 载波"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm6yl6cqqw0","created":1793771591815,"text":"fL5 = 115 * f0 = 1176.45 MHz，波长 λ5 = 25.48 cm"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm8a6qntk80","created":1793775321871,"text":"第三个民用信号，专为生命安全等高要求应用设计，功率更高、带宽更大，抗干扰和多径能力更强"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm766xxd9c0","created":1793772187744,"text":"选择两个载频的目的是消除由于电离层效应而引起的延迟误差"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlc5m7yuxk0","created":1793684688231,"text":"测距码(粗C/A码)"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm8jzkvvjk0","created":1793776089926,"text":"是一种伪随机码，PRN"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm8lfj65340","created":1793776203015,"text":"周期为1ms，对应1023个码片"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlc5oyhdls0","created":1793684694188,"text":"数据码（导航电文，D码）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm990ap7ao0","created":1793778050591,"text":"LNAV电文","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm8nggk9r40","created":1793776361762,"text":"导航电文速率是 50 bps，一个导航电文比特持续 20 ms","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm8o76x7w80","created":1793776419952,"text":"一个主帧1500bit，30s传输完一个主帧"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm995ai6gg0","created":1793778061463,"text":"CNAV"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm996wa4400","created":1793778064956,"text":"CNAV-2"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dml932899eg0","created":1793676024655,"text":"GPS卫星的导航电文","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm8t737ul40","created":1793776811549,"text":"LNAV电文"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm8th9xkpc0","created":1793776833723,"text":"一个主帧（传输需30s）包含五个子帧（一个子帧传输需6s），每个子帧包含十个字码（一个字码传输需0.6s，30bit），字码内的“二进制数”20ms发送一次"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm8xat1db40","created":1793777133097,"text":"遥测码 TLW"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm8xmcl0480","created":1793777158224,"text":"位于各子帧开头，表明卫星注入数据的状态"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm8y8gcotk0","created":1793777206341,"text":"转换码 HOW"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm8yhwixbs0","created":1793777226910,"text":"位于各子帧第二个字码，帮助用户从捕获的C/A码转换到捕获P码的Z计数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm900oe5og0","created":1793777346141,"text":"用户可以据此将接收机的时间精确对准GPS时，并快速捕获P码"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm90lqgemg0","created":1793777391978,"text":"第一数据块"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm90qc8xuo0","created":1793777402003,"text":"第一子帧的3至10字码"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm918eyk200","created":1793777441349,"text":"标识码，时延差改正"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm91ivbc8w0","created":1793777464106,"text":"星期序号"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm92eauqeg0","created":1793777532526,"text":"数据龄期"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm91q55uhc0","created":1793777479939,"text":"卫星时钟改正系数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm91m5k3kw0","created":1793777471256,"text":"卫星健康状况"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm922cuxyw0","created":1793777506526,"text":"等"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm93ogf23c0","created":1793777632994,"text":"第二数据块"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm93s48ki80","created":1793777640965,"text":"包含第二第三子帧"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm941t985c0","created":1793777662069,"text":"星历"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm94hxdhiw0","created":1793777697146,"text":"时间2参数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm94qiullc0","created":1793777715859,"text":"星历参考时刻"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm94tv4cqw0","created":1793777723131,"text":"数据龄期"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm950v9auo0","created":1793777738377,"text":"开普勒6参数"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm956sw5800","created":1793777751295,"text":"轨道摄动9参数"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm95eq2law0","created":1793777768538,"text":"第三数据块"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm95jr3cww0","created":1793777779484,"text":"包含第四第五子帧"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm95xzjnqg0","created":1793777810470,"text":"包含所有GPS卫星的历书数据"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm96ymhe940","created":1793777890221,"text":"用于加快搜星速度"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dml93fhfsog0","created":1793676053508,"text":"GPS卫星位置的计算步骤"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmmwrlaok3s0","created":1793844392385,"text":"1、计算卫星运行的平均角速度n"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dml93qifoeg0","created":1793676077513,"text":"BDS导航电文与卫星坐标计算","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dml942i5bmw0","created":1793676103617,"text":"GPS接收机基本工作原理"},"children":[]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue-compat","version":"1.4.43"}